mily:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none; width:1%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:44%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:11.2pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Реестрга тегишли ўзгартиришлар киритади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none; width:1%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:21%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Беш иш куни ичида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none; width:1%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none; width:1%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none; width:1%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8206416" id="8206416"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="8206417" id="8206417">Атроф-муҳитга таъсирни баҳолаш материалларини ва экологик нормативлар лойиҳаларини ишлаб чиқувчиларнинг фаолиятини ташкил этиш ва рейтингини юритиш тартиби тўғрисидаги <a href="https://lex.uz/uz/docs/8193120#8205888">низомга</a><br />2-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8206418" id="8206418"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="8206421" id="8206421"><table class="Table" style="width: 823px; border-collapse: collapse;" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td colspan="2" style="width:50%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white"><p></p></td><td colspan="2" style="width: 394px; padding: 0cm 4px; height: 19px; background-color: white;"><p align="center" style="margin-left:45px; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон Республикаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="margin-left:45px; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология ва иқлим ўзгариши </span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="margin-left:45px; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><